   "testo": "The centre of Trento preserves a Renaissance character, visible in its painted façades, squares and historic palaces, while the mountains form a constant backdrop to the urban landscape. The Buonconsiglio Castle tells the story of the prince-bishops' past; the Cathedral and Piazza Duomo are the religious and civic heart of the city. Alongside the historical heritage, the MUSE offers an interactive approach to the natural sciences, biodiversity and environmental change. The university presence fuels exhibitions, lectures and cultural initiatives, creating a balance between historical memory and contemporary outreach.",
